# Bitwarden CLI local state — NEVER commit.
# storage/path.rs resolves appdata to ./bw-data when it exists, so running the
# binary from the repo root drops data.json here. That file holds access and
# refresh tokens plus the session-sealed user key.
bw-data/
data.json
__PROTECTED__*
*.bwsession
